  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">Для вопросов, проблем или помощи最快的方式是联系我的 Discord：Mama's Mods：&lt;a href=\"https://discord.gg/2QWyQ8fkUr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"&gt;https://discord.gg/2QWyQ8fkUr&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">1.21.1 已经可用！1.20.1 已发布！尽情享用！:) </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">1.19.1 现在也提供了！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">--------------------------------------------------</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px;color:#008000\">1.19 也已发布！尽情享用！&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">---------------------------------------------------</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px;color:#f00\">1.18.2 现已可供下载！感谢您的耐心等待！&lt;3</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">此模组添加与假期季节相关的花朵。本模组中的所有花朵都可以放入花盆中。<br><img src=\"https://imgur.com/PZaHgO4.png\" alt=\"Flowers/deco\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\"><br>此外还有一些树木——一种可以用来制作冬青装饰的紫杉树，以及被槲寄生覆盖的森林树木。可以从这些叶子上收集槲寄生并将其制成悬挂装饰。&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/pCyYVD2.png\" alt=\"Trees\" width=\"500\" height=\"274\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">冬青可以添加到灯笼中，用于制作花环和烛台，也可以单独放置在任何方块方向上。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px;color:#936\">花朵可以在以下生物群系中找到：</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px;color:#936\">圣诞仙人掌 &amp; 孤挺花：沙漠/高原</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px;color:#936\">水仙花 &amp; 一品红（白色和红色）：丛林/热带草原</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px;color:#936\">圣诞山茶：平原/森林</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px;color:#936\">冬青果、雪片莲、圣诞玫瑰、常绿：寒冷/针叶林/冰原</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px;color:#936\">紫杉树分布在寒冷/针叶林/冰原地带，而被槲寄生侵袭的桦树/普通森林中的树木则比较稀有。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px;color:#008000\">树叶：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px;color:#008000\">将紫杉、一品红或槲寄生侵扰过的树叶放入工作台以生成以下物品：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px;color:#008000\">紫杉树叶：冬青枝芽</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px;color:#008000\">一品红树叶（红色或白色）：一品红植物（可种植，也可盆栽）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px;color:#008000\">槲寄生侵扰的树叶：槲寄生球</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">合成配方：</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/anEN0pb.png\" alt=\"Crafting Recipes\" width=\"700\" height=\"403\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:36px;color:#f00\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:24px\">我非常兴奋地宣布我现在正与<strong>Akliz</strong>合作！</span></span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px;color:#f00\">如果您需要托管服务器，这绝对是最佳选择！他们的服务质量卓越，客户服务/support 非常棒！使用下方横幅链接可获得折扣！ :) </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.akliz.net%252fmaideniles\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#800080\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Is3Z041.png\" alt=\"Akliz\" width=\"1899\" height=\"245\"></span></a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:36px\">&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.akliz.net%252fmaideniles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.akliz.net/maideniles</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:36px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:36px\">&nbsp;</span></p>",
